%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant CB as Circuit Breaker
    participant R as Retry Logic
    participant S as Service
    participant F as Fallback

    Note over CB: State: CLOSED (healthy)

    C->>CB: Request 1
    CB->>R: Forward request
    R->>S: Attempt 1
    S-->>R: 500 Internal Server Error
    R->>S: Attempt 2 (after 1s backoff)
    S-->>R: 500 Internal Server Error
    R->>S: Attempt 3 (after 2s backoff)
    S-->>R: 200 OK
    R-->>CB: Success
    CB-->>C: Response

    Note over CB: Failure count: 0 (reset on success)

    C->>CB: Request 2
    CB->>R: Forward request
    R->>S: Attempt 1
    S-->>R: 503 Service Unavailable
    R->>S: Attempt 2
    S-->>R: 503 Service Unavailable
    R->>S: Attempt 3
    S-->>R: 503 Service Unavailable
    R-->>CB: Max retries exhausted

    Note over CB: Failure count: 1/3

    C->>CB: Request 3
    CB->>R: Forward request
    R->>S: All 3 attempts fail
    R-->>CB: Failure

    Note over CB: Failure count: 2/3

    C->>CB: Request 4
    CB->>R: Forward request
    R->>S: All 3 attempts fail
    R-->>CB: Failure

    Note over CB: Failure count: 3/3<br/>State: OPEN

    rect rgb(253, 237, 236)
        C->>CB: Request 5
        CB-->>C: Fail fast (circuit open)
        Note right of CB: No request sent to service

        C->>CB: Request 6
        CB-->>C: Fail fast (circuit open)
    end

    Note over CB: After 30s timeout<br/>State: HALF-OPEN

    rect rgb(232, 248, 245)
        C->>CB: Request 7 (probe)
        CB->>S: Single test request
        S-->>CB: 200 OK
        Note over CB: State: CLOSED (recovered)
    end

    C->>CB: Request 8
    CB->>R: Forward request
    R->>S: Attempt 1
    S-->>R: 200 OK
    R-->>CB: Success
    CB-->>C: Response
